            "review_title": "Review at Pho 24",
            "review_text": "philiplk\nLondon, United Kingdom1095 contributions\n0\nAverage food\nDec 2022 • Family\nWe had dinner here whilst staying at the nearby ibis saigon South Hotel. It is a chain and the food is ok. I ordered the pho combo which came with a drink. The pho had beef slices and beef balls. It was OK and not the nest pho I had tasted. I ordered the lime juice. The fried rolls were OK. Caramel flan wasn't bad. They not serve the best food but it's OK if you are looking for a quick meal close to where you are.\nRead more\nWritten December 20, 2022",
